  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Query entry",
      "items": [
        "useChat posts {q, thread_id} to /api/query; thread_id is the memory key",
        "FastAPI runs NeMo Rails first — a fired rail returns immediately and never invokes the graph",
        "Graph runs synchronously so Logfire context is preserved"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Hybrid retrieval",
      "items": [
        "Dense kNN (20) and BM25 sparse (20) both run inside Qdrant",
        "RRF merges by rank position, so incomparable scores never need normalising",
        "FlashRank cross-encoder trims the fused list to the top 5 passages",
        "Missing sparse index or reranker failure degrades gracefully, it does not fail the request",
        "Ingestion (app/Ingestion/processor.py) writes the same dense + BM25 points into rag-v1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Self-RAG loop",
      "items": [
        "Grader returns JSON {relevant: [indices], confidence}",
        "Empty verdict routes to the rewriter, which caps at MAX_RETRIEVAL_RETRIES (2)",
        "Malformed grader output fails open so a flaky judge cannot poison a good answer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "LLM access",
      "items": [
        "Planner, grader and rewriter call Groq directly via ChatGroq",
        "Only the responder goes through Portkey, so it can read x-portkey-cache-status",
        "Portkey adds fallback, simple cache and 2 retries on 429/503"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Source map (repo paths)",
      "items": [
        "UI: frontend/src/App.tsx, hooks/useChat.ts, lib/api.ts, vite.config.ts",
        "API + guardrails: app/main.py, app/guardrails/rails.py, colang_rules.py",
        "Graph: app/agents/graph.py, state.py, nodes/{planner,retriever,grader,rewriter,responder}.py",
        "Retrieval: app/services/Retrieval/{qdrant_service,embeddings,fusion,ranking_service,schema}.py",
        "LLM + storage: app/gateway/client.py, app/config.py",
        "Ingestion: app/Ingestion/processor.py"
      ]
    }
  ]
